Package: ducksvantage
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Patopatetico2-lab <https://github.com/Patopatetico2-lab/DucksVantage>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pyqt6, python3-psutil
Recommends: python3-pynvml | python3-pip, pkexec | policykit-1
Homepage: https://github.com/Patopatetico2-lab/DucksVantage
Description: Universal Lenovo Vantage replacement for Linux
 Lightweight native Linux control center for Lenovo Legion, LOQ,
 IdeaPad Gaming, IdeaPad, and Yoga laptops. Provides ACPI thermal
 profiles (Quiet, Balanced, Performance, Max-Power), Battery
 Conservation Mode (~80%), Custom TDP (PL1/PL2), Game Auto-Switch,
 Eco-Mode, KDE Plasma 6 Plasmoid, and non-intrusive OSD alerts.
